1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,860
San Mateo, Kapitulo 2

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:07,920
Nayanak ni Jesus itiili a Bethlehem ijehudya.

3
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,720
Idi ni Herodes tiagdama nga ari,

4
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,720
saan anabayag kalpasan ti panakayanak na,

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:18,220
at damamasirib alalaki at agadaya anapan ijehudya.

6
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,840
Sa dinot ayan, tiubing anayanak, nga ari dagdihudyo?

7
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,620
Sinalud sudda,

8
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,020
Nakitami tibitwin na,

9
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:29,060
anag parang ijaydaya,

10
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:31,560
katimay kami agdaydayaw kin kuwana.

11
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,420
Idi madamag daytoy ni ari Herodes,

12
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,080
na palalo ti panakariribok na,

13
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:40,420
kastamu titunggal may sa ataga Hiruzalem.

14
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,080
Pinaayapan ng ro,

15
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:45,440
dagit ipangulwen apapadi kin mamaestro itilinteg,

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,740
kit sinalud sudda kadakwada,

17
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,640
no sa dinot ipakayanakan ti Kristo.

18
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,020
Insungbat da,

19
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:55,340
Itiili a Bethlehem ijehudya,

20
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,000
ta daytoy tin surat,

21
00:00:57,020 --> 00:01:00,940
Sika Bethlehem iti dagati huda,

22
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:04,360
saan ka amaudi kadagiti ili iti huda?

23
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:07,920
Tatumaod tukin ka timay sa apangulo,

24
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,760
amangaywan itiilik nga Israel.

25
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:15,000
Inayaban nga rod ni Herodes dagiti sanga ili,

26
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:17,560
kit kinasaritan na ida itinalimed,

27
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,700
sinalud sudda kadakwada,

28
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:22,420
no kaano ti panagparang tibitwen.

29
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:23,940
Itikasta,

30
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:25,940
imbaun na ida iji Bethlehem,

31
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:28,820
at imbilin na kadakwada.

32
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:42,240
Pimano dakit idi at dada itidalan,

33
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:46,160
nakita damanen na ibitwen anagparang iji daya.

34
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:47,860
Idimakita da,

35
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:49,780
anyan naragsakda,

36
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:51,580
anyan naraguda.

37
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:56,880
Indaldalan na ida aginga anagsardeng itinga tuwen tibalay ayan tibing.

38
00:01:57,020 --> 00:02:01,720
Simrek da iti balay kit nakita dati ubing kinimariya nga ina na,

39
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:05,220
nagparintumeng da anagrokbav kin kuwana.

40
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:06,620
Kalpasan na,

41
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:09,820
inwarda dagiti sagsago da abalitok,

42
00:02:09,820 --> 00:02:11,820
insenso kin mera,

43
00:02:11,820 --> 00:02:13,820
kit indatun da kin kuwana.

44
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:16,400
Idi agawid da itiili da,

45
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:19,140
sabalin adalan itinagnaan da,

46
00:02:19,140 --> 00:02:21,140
ta iti tagtagainap,

47
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:23,140
pinakdaaran ida ti Diyos,

48
00:02:23,140 --> 00:02:25,940
adidan agsubli kin ni Herodes.

49
00:02:25,940 --> 00:02:28,940
Kalpasan ti ipapanaw dagiti mamasirib,

50
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:32,440
nagparang kinihuse timaysang anghel ti apo,

51
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,940
itimaysa at tagtagainap.

52
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:35,940
Kinunana,

53
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:37,940
Bumangon ka,

54
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:41,940
inkaipak ni dagiti agina ijay Egypto.

55
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,940
Agyan kayo sa jay,

56
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:46,940
agingat ibagak at pumanaw kayo.

57
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:48,940
Tasapulento ni Herodes ti ubing,

58
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:50,940
tap'no papapatay na.

59
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:52,940
Bimangon ni Jose,

60
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:55,940
innala na dagiti agina kit nagropo,

61
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,940
buwat da iti daytara bi,

62
00:02:57,940 --> 00:02:59,940
anapan ijay Egypto.

63
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:00,940
Nagyanda sa jay,

64
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:02,940
agingat ipapatay ni Herodes.

65
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:04,940
Na aramid daytoy,

66
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:06,940
tap'no matumpal tiinsaot ti apo,

67
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:08,940
babaen iti profeta.

68
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:10,940
Manipot Egypto,

69
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:12,940
inayabak ti anak ko.

70
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,940
Napalalo apungtot ni Herodes,

71
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:17,940
idimadlaw na asinikapan dagiti mamasirib.

72
00:03:17,940 --> 00:03:19,940
Itikasta,

73
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:22,940
imbilin na amapapatay aming ubing

74
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:23,940
alalaki nga agtawen,

75
00:03:23,940 --> 00:03:26,940
itidwa winunabababa itiili a Bethlehem

76
00:03:26,940 --> 00:03:29,940
ken kadagiti kabangibang na.

77
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:31,940
Naibatay daytoy nga aramid,

78
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:33,940
itikinunadagiti sangaili

79
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:36,940
maipapan itipanagparan ti bituen.

80
00:03:36,940 --> 00:03:39,940
Natung pangarod ti impadto ni profeta,

81
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:40,940
Jeremias.

82
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,940
Ijay Rama,

83
00:03:42,940 --> 00:03:44,940
nangngeg ti panagikis,

84
00:03:44,940 --> 00:03:47,940
dungdungaw ken nasaem asangsangit.

85
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:50,940
Dungdungawan ni Raquel dagiti anak na,

86
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:53,940
agsangsangit ket di na kayat ti maliuliwan,

87
00:03:53,940 --> 00:03:56,940
tanatay da amin apada-pada.

88
00:03:56,940 --> 00:03:58,940
Kalpasan anatay ni Herodes,

89
00:03:58,940 --> 00:04:00,940
nagparang ititagtagainip

90
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:02,940
ti may sanganghel ti apo

91
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:04,940
kin ni Jose ije he Egypto.

92
00:04:04,940 --> 00:04:06,940
Bumangon ka.

93
00:04:06,940 --> 00:04:08,940
Kino na ti anghel?

94
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:12,940
Yahawid mon dagiti ag ina iti dagat Israel.

95
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:14,940
Natayon dagiti nagpanggep

96
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:17,940
amang papatay iti ubing.

97
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,940
Bimangon nga rod ni Jose,

98
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:21,940
inalana dagiti ag ina

99
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,940
kit nagsublida ije Israel,

100
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:25,940
